(37,0,'ControlQ03','<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Write a program to input the grade of Information Technology Basic in 10 score scale then convert to a 4.0 score scale corresponding <br>as the following table.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">4.0 score scale&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Letter Grade<br>mark = 4.00&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>3.50 ≤ mark &lt; 4.00&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>3.00 ≤ mark &lt; 3.50&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B<br>2.50 ≤ mark &lt; 3.00&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C+<br>2.00 ≤ mark &lt; 2.50&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C<br>1.50 ≤ mark &lt; 2.00&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D+<br>1.00 ≤ mark &lt; 1.50&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D<br>mark &lt; 1.00&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; F<br>Example:<br>Input &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Output<br>mark = 0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Diem theo thang 4 la 0.00 – Diem F<br>mark = 5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Diem theo thang 4 la 2.00 – Diem C<br>mark = 7.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Diem theo thang 4 la 3.00 – Diem B<br>mark = 8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Diem theo thang 4 la 3.20 – Diem B+<br>mark = 10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Diem theo thang 4 la 4.00 – Diem A<br>mark = -1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Khong hop le<br>mark = 11&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Khong hop le<br><br><br></p>',1,'',1,1.0000000,0.0000000,'coderunner',1,'unknownhost+260921032619+lGxI4S',1789961179,1789961179,2,2),
