(51,0,'FunctionQ01','<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Define a Calculator function&nbsp; to calculate addition, subtraction, multiplication, division of two integer a, b and an option.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">In case value of option is:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\'+\': printf out result of a + b<br>\'-\': printf out result of a - b<br>\'*\': printf out result of a * b<br>\'/\': printf out result of a / b<br>other: printf out result of \"Not Existing\"<br></p>',1,'',1,1.0000000,0.0000000,'coderunner',1,'unknownhost+260921032619+rXmDY9',1789961179,1789961179,2,2),
